# Way of the Cook (otherAreas 1): its trade replies' kinds against Rycharde the Chef accepted (a GM), whose trade answers
# exactly one meat among the items (hasItemQty(meat, 1)) with 73 (Event; RQ1 sorts before RQ2). Accepted (a GM), EndTime
# 790189201 (a GM: one second left): the meat and the chip: Way of the Cook's 80 (Progress beats RQ1's 73; a Progress 73
# would tie and play first, as RQ1 is the earlier container), finished: completed, 1500 gil. Made available and accepted
# again (a GM), EndTime 790189200 (none left), a meat and a chip again (a GM); Take: RQ1's 68, then Way of the Cook's
# accepted 65 (Event: a tie, the cycle's next); back at Rycharde: 81 (Progress beats 73), finished: completed, 1000 gil.
lists Mhaura/Rycharde/onTrade Mhaura/onEventFinish/80 Mhaura/onEventFinish/81
char zone=Mhaura pos=18.9,-16,88.8 job=WAR lvl=30
quest OtherAreas.RychardeTheChef accepted
quest OtherAreas.WayOfTheCook accepted
charvar Quest[4][1]EndTime 790189201
item SliceOfDhalmelMeat
item BeehiveChip
login
trade Rycharde SliceOfDhalmelMeat x1 BeehiveChip x1 # in time: 80 (Progress beats RQ1's 73)
finish                                  # completed: the trade taken, 1500 gil, DayCompleted 8000
quest OtherAreas.WayOfTheCook available # a GM
quest OtherAreas.WayOfTheCook accepted  # a GM
charvar Quest[4][1]EndTime 790189200    # a GM: none left
item SliceOfDhalmelMeat                 # a GM
item BeehiveChip                        # a GM
trigger Take                            # accepted: RQ1's 68 (a tie with Way of the Cook's 65: the first container's)
finish
trigger Take                            # Way of the Cook's 65 (Event; a Progress 65 would have played first)
finish
walk 18.9,-16,88.8                      # back to Rycharde (a trade does not walk)
trade Rycharde SliceOfDhalmelMeat x1 BeehiveChip x1 # late: 81 (Progress beats RQ1's 73)
finish                                  # completed: the trade taken, 1000 gil
